---
const photos = [
  { src: "/images/photo-01.jpg", alt: "Nuestro primer recuerdo", caption: "El comienzo de algo hermoso" },
  { src: "/images/photo-02.jpg", alt: "Un día juntos", caption: "Esos días que guardo en el corazón" },
  { src: "/images/photo-03.jpg", alt: "Un momento especial", caption: "Mi sonrisa favorita" },
  { src: "/images/photo-04.jpg", alt: "Otro recuerdo juntos", caption: "Con vos todo es diferente" },
  { src: "/images/photo-05.jpg", alt: "Un momento inolvidable", caption: "Pequeños momentos, grandes recuerdos" },
  { src: "/images/photo-06.jpg", alt: "Nosotros", caption: "Y los que todavía nos esperan" },
  { src: "/images/photo-07.jpg", alt: "Nosotros", caption: "Y los que todavía nos esperan" },
  { src: "/images/photo-08.jpg", alt: "Nosotros", caption: "Y los que todavía nos esperan" },
];
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="es">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#f8edf5" />
    <meta name="description" content="Una pequeña historia hecha con amor." />
    <title>A little piece of us ♡</title>

    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link
      href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600&family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;1,400;1,500&display=swap"
      rel="stylesheet"
    />
  </head>

  <body>
    <audio id="music" loop preload="none">
      <source src="/audio/our-song.mp3" type="audio/mpeg" />
    </audio>

    <button class="music-button" id="musicButton" aria-label="Activar música">
      ♫ <span id="musicLabel">PLAY MUSIC</span>
    </button>

    <main>
      <!-- PORTADA -->
      <section class="hero">
        <div class="hero-glow"></div>

        <span class="eyebrow"> A LITTLE GIFT FOR YOU ♡ </span>

        <h1>
          To my<br />
          <em>favorite person.</em>
        </h1>

        <p class="hero-description">Para vos, Vida. Una pequeña historia de dos personas, muchos recuerdos y un sentimiento enorme.</p>

        <a href="#story" class="start-button">
          Empezar nuestro viaje
          <span>↓</span>
        </a>

        <div class="hero-bottom">A LITTLE JOURNEY THROUGH OUR MEMORIES</div>
      </section>

      <!-- HISTORIA -->
      <section id="story" class="story">
        <div class="section-heading reveal">
          <span class="eyebrow">CHAPTER ONE</span>

          <h2>
            Everything is<br />
            <em>better with you.</em>
          </h2>

          <p>Vida, estos son algunos de mis recuerdos favoritos. Y todos tienen algo en común: vos.</p>
        </div>

        {
          photos.map((photo, index) => (
            <>
              <article class={`photo-card photo-${index + 1}`}>
                <div class="photo-frame">
                  <img src={photo.src} alt={photo.alt} loading={index === 0 ? "eager" : "lazy"} />
                </div>
                <p class="photo-caption">{photo.caption}</p>
                <span class="photo-number">MEMORY Nº {String(index + 1).padStart(2, "0")}</span>
              </article>

              {index === 1 && (
                <div class="quote reveal">
                  <span>✳</span>
                  <p>"De todos los lugares del mundo, mi favorito siempre va a ser donde estés vos."</p>
                  <small>A THOUGHT ABOUT YOU</small>
                </div>
              )}

              {index === 3 && (
                <div class="quote reveal">
                  <span>♡</span>
                  <p>"No son solamente las grandes aventuras. Son también todas esas pequeñas cosas con vos."</p>
                  <small>MY FAVORITE MOMENTS</small>
                </div>
              )}
            </>
          ))
        }
      </section>

      <!-- TRANSICIÓN FINAL -->
      <section class="ending">
        <span class="eyebrow">AND THERE'S MORE...</span>

        <h2>
          Our story<br />
          <em>isn't finished.</em>
        </h2>

        <p>Vida, todavía nos quedan tantos momentos por vivir, tantas risas y tantos recuerdos por crear.</p>

        <div class="heart">♡</div>

        <button class="letter-button" id="openLetter">
          Hay algo que quiero decirte
          <span>→</span>
        </button>
      </section>

      <!-- CARTA -->
      <section class="letter-section" id="letter">
        <div class="letter-paper">
          <span class="eyebrow">A LETTER FOR YOU</span>
          <h2>Para vos, <em>mi amor.</em></h2>

          <div class="letter-content">
            <p>Mi amor:</p>

            <p>Quería regalarte algo diferente, algo que pudieras guardar y volver a mirar cuando quisieras recordar lo mucho que significás para mí.</p>

            <p>Cada una de estas fotos guarda un pedacito de nuestra historia. Momentos que quizás parecen pequeños, pero que para mí significan muchísimo.</p>

            <p>Gracias por tu compañía, por tus sonrisas, por cada abrazo y por hacer que tantos días sean especiales simplemente por compartirlos con vos.</p>

            <p>No sé cuántos recuerdos nos esperan, pero sí sé que quiero seguir construyéndolos a tu lado.</p>

            <p class="signature">
              Te quiero muchísimo.<br />
              <em>Siempre nosotros. ♡</em>
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="letter-decoration">♡</div>
        </div>

        <footer>MADE WITH ALL MY LOVE · JUST FOR YOU</footer>
      </section>
    </main>

    <script>
      import gsap from "gsap";
      import { ScrollTrigger } from "gsap/ScrollTrigger";

      gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);

      // Música: requiere interacción de la visitante
      const music = document.querySelector("#music") as HTMLAudioElement | null;
      const musicButton = document.querySelector("#musicButton") as HTMLButtonElement | null;
      const musicLabel = document.querySelector("#musicLabel") as HTMLElement | null;

      musicButton?.addEventListener("click", async () => {
        if (!music || !musicButton || !musicLabel) return;

        if (music.paused) {
          try {
            await music.play();
            musicLabel.textContent = "MUSIC ON ♡";
            musicButton.classList.add("playing");
            musicButton.setAttribute("aria-label", "Pausar música");
          } catch {
            musicLabel.textContent = "TRY AGAIN";
          }
        } else {
          music.pause();
          musicLabel.textContent = "PLAY MUSIC";
          musicButton.classList.remove("playing");
          musicButton.setAttribute("aria-label", "Activar música");
        }
      });

      // Animaciones de entrada
      const reduceMotion = window.matchMedia("(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)").matches;

      if (!reduceMotion) {
        gsap.from(".hero .eyebrow, .hero h1, .hero-description, .start-button", {
          opacity: 0,
          y: 30,
          duration: 1.2,
          stagger: 0.2,
          ease: "power3.out",
        });

        // Fotografías
        gsap.utils.toArray<HTMLElement>(".photo-card").forEach((card) => {
          gsap.from(card, {
            opacity: 0,
            y: 70,
            duration: 1.1,
            ease: "power2.out",
            scrollTrigger: {
              trigger: card,
              start: "top 85%",
              toggleActions: "play none none reverse",
            },
          });

          const img = card.querySelector("img");
          if (!img) return;

          gsap.from(img, {
            scale: 1.12,
            duration: 1.5,
            ease: "power2.out",
            scrollTrigger: {
              trigger: card,
              start: "top 85%",
              toggleActions: "play none none reverse",
            },
          });
        });

        // Frases y títulos
        gsap.utils.toArray<HTMLElement>(".reveal").forEach((element) => {
          gsap.from(element, {
            opacity: 0,
            y: 45,
            duration: 1.2,
            ease: "power2.out",
            scrollTrigger: {
              trigger: element,
              start: "top 80%",
            },
          });
        });

        // Carta
        gsap.from(".letter-paper", {
          opacity: 0,
          y: 60,
          duration: 1.2,
          ease: "power2.out",
          scrollTrigger: {
            trigger: ".letter-section",
            start: "top 75%",
          },
        });
      }

      // Abrir la carta
      document.querySelector("#openLetter")?.addEventListener("click", () => {
        document.querySelector("#letter")?.scrollIntoView({
          behavior: reduceMotion ? "instant" : "smooth",
        });
      });
    </script>
  </body>
</html>

<style>
  :root {
    --background: #f8edf5;
    --pink: #e8c8df;
    --lavender: #dcd2ef;
    --purple: #876a91;
    --dark: #5c4862;
    --muted: #a28ba4;
  }

  * {
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  html {
    scroll-behavior: smooth;
  }

  body {
    margin: 0;
    background: var(--background);
    color: var(--dark);
    font-family: "DM Sans", sans-serif;
    overflow-x: hidden;
  }

  h1,
  h2,
  p {
    margin-top: 0;
  }

  h1,
  h2 {
    font-family: "Playfair Display", serif;
    font-weight: 400;
  }

  em {
    color: var(--purple);
    font-weight: 400;
  }

  .hero {
    min-height: 100svh;
    padding: 100px 24px 70px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    text-align: center;
    position: relative;
    isolation: isolate;
  }

  .hero-glow {
    position: absolute;
    z-index: -1;
    width: 340px;
    height: 340px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #e9d6ed;
    filter: blur(90px);
    opacity: 0.8;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 3px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .hero h1 {
    font-size: clamp(58px, 12vw, 100px);
    line-height: 1.08;
    margin: 30px 0;
    color: #6c5473;
  }

  .hero-description {
    max-width: 320px;
    line-height: 1.9;
    color: #987f9a;
    font-size: 14px;
  }

  .start-button,
  .letter-button {
    margin-top: 35px;
    text-decoration: none;
    border: 1px solid #cdb5ce;
    color: var(--purple);
    border-radius: 50px;
    padding: 16px 24px;
    background: #ffffff55;
    font-family: inherit;
    font-size: 12px;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: 0.3s;
  }

  .start-button span,
  .letter-button span {
    margin-left: 12px;
  }

  .start-button:hover,
  .letter-button:hover {
    background: white;
    transform: translateY(-3px);
  }

  .hero-bottom {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 30px;
    font-size: 9px;
    letter-spacing: 3px;
    color: #b39ab2;
  }

  .music-button {
    position: fixed;
    z-index: 20;
    right: 18px;
    top: 18px;
    border: 1px solid #d8bfd7;
    background: #fffaf0e8;
    color: var(--purple);
    border-radius: 40px;
    padding: 11px 15px;
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    cursor: pointer;
    backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
  }

  .music-button.playing {
    background: #e9d8eb;
  }

  .story {
    max-width: 760px;
    padding: 100px 24px;
    margin: auto;
  }

  .section-heading {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 100px;
  }

  .section-heading h2,
  .ending h2 {
    font-size: clamp(42px, 8vw, 65px);
    line-height: 1.15;
    margin: 25px 0;
  }

  .section-heading p {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .photo-card {
    max-width: 540px;
    margin: 0 auto 125px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .photo-frame {
    padding: 10px;
    background: #fffaf9;
    border-radius: 5px;
    box-shadow: 0 15px 50px #a98ba51c;
    transform: rotate(-1deg);
  }

  .photo-2 .photo-frame,
  .photo-5 .photo-frame {
    transform: rotate(1.2deg);
  }

  .photo-frame img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 4 / 5;
    object-fit: cover;
    border-radius: 2px;
  }

  .photo-caption {
    font-family: "Playfair Display", serif;
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 19px;
    margin: 22px 0 10px;
    color: #806b87;
  }

  .photo-number {
    color: #b69db4;
    letter-spacing: 3px;
    font-size: 9px;
  }

  .quote {
    min-height: 300px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 35px 15px;
    margin: 30px 0 100px;
  }

  .quote > span {
    color: #b68db1;
    font-size: 28px;
  }

  .quote p {
    font-family: "Playfair Display", serif;
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: clamp(26px, 5vw, 38px);
    max-width: 550px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    margin: 25px 0;
  }

  .quote small {
    letter-spacing: 3px;
    font-size: 9px;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .ending {
    min-height: 90svh;
    background: linear-gradient(160deg, #ead9ef, #f8dfe9, #f7eaf0);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 60px 25px;
  }

  .ending h2 {
    color: #715779;
  }

  .ending p {
    max-width: 300px;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: #947b98;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .heart {
    font-size: 42px;
    color: #c78ba9;
    margin: 25px 0 0;
  }

  .letter-section {
    min-height: 100svh;
    padding: 100px 20px 45px;
    background: #f8edf5;
  }

  .letter-paper {
    max-width: 570px;
    margin: auto;
    padding: clamp(30px, 7vw, 65px);
    background: #fffaf7;
    box-shadow: 0 20px 70px #a88ba51c;
    position: relative;
  }

  .letter-paper h2 {
    font-size: clamp(35px, 7vw, 48px);
    margin: 30px 0;
  }

  .letter-content {
    color: #806e7c;
    font-family: "Playfair Display", serif;
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 2;
  }

  .letter-content p {
    margin-bottom: 22px;
  }

  .signature {
    margin-top: 45px;
    color: #80618a;
  }

  .letter-decoration {
    color: #d6b0c9;
    font-size: 28px;
    text-align: right;
  }

  footer {
    padding: 55px 10px 20px;
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 9px;
    letter-spacing: 3px;
    color: #ac92aa;
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .photo-card {
      margin-bottom: 160px;
    }

    .photo-frame img {
      aspect-ratio: 5 / 4;
    }

    .story {
      padding-top: 150px;
      padding-bottom: 150px;
    }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    *,
    *::before,
    *::after {
      scroll-behavior: auto !important;
    }
  }
</style>
